<title>USA: Most U.S. stock index futures higher, off highs.</title>
<headline>Most U.S. stock index futures higher, off highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>Aug 19 - Most U.S. stock index futures remained higher after the FOMC left U.S. rates unchnaged after its August meeting today. Sept S&amp;P 500 hit its session high just as the Fed announced no rate change, then Sept cut gains. Sept slipped toward 920.00 support, but that level was not breached.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk, 312-408-8750))</p>
